IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `cdra-neighbours`

-- Community Disputes Resolution Act 2015, ss 4, 6 to 12A, 13L, 13N, 13R, 13U, 13W, 17, 25, 26, 29 and 34 -- worked cases.
--
-- Every assertion is a claim about the ENCODING on stated facts, not about the law. Nothing here has been checked
-- against a decided case or subsidiary legislation (none was retrieved).
--
-- Fixtures are generated from a table of which flags are set (scratchpad gen_community-disputes-resolution-act-2015.py). Expected results were written by
-- hand from the text.

